|~ The verbs of explanations [D98]. Each resides on
   `::qlang/explanation`, the kind of what `explain` answers: the page
   `docs` reads for a value and the value itself [D100]. ~|

:doc
  |~~ The page of what the explanation explains: of a name its own, of
      a value the page of the kind it shows, of an error the page of its
      site [D7]; null for a declaration without one.

      ~("x" | add 1 !| explain | doc | eq (::AddLeftNotNumberError | docs | first))
      ~(42 | explain | doc | eq (::number | docs | first))
  ~~|
  ::verb~(:returns #[::doc ::null] | /doc)

:value
  |~~ The value the explanation explains; an error among them raised, as
      it arrived before `!|` opened it [D101].

      ~(42 | explain | value | eq 42)
      ~("x" | add 1 !| explain | value !| type | eq ::AddLeftNotNumberError)
  ~~|
  ::verb~(/value)
